{"code":"258610","name":"케일럼","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"핸드셋","sector_desc":"휴대폰 부품·완제품. 주요 고객사의 신제품 출시 사이클을 따라 움직입니다.","desc":"동사는 2009년 지열발전설비 등을 생산하는 제조업체로 설립되어 2017년 코스닥시장에 상장되었으며, 2026년 3월 종속회사였던 하나아이티엠(주)과 합병하여 존속회사로 남았음. 현재 비상장 종속회사인 (주)키위플러스를 보유하고 있음. 동사는 플랜트기자재 부문과 항공부품 부문을 영위하고 있으며, 플랜트기자재 부문에서는 지열발전설비(열수기화기, 응축기, 배관 등)와 화공/LNG설비(열교환기, 압력용기, 타워 등)를 제조하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":1114.0,"open":1114.0,"high":1148.0,"low":1026.0,"volume":9759,"amount":10871526.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":10.9515,"ret_5":-1.7637,"ret_20":-9.1354,"ret_60":6.0952,"ret_120":-22.6389,"ret_250":-40.7447,"ma20":1162.35,"ma60":1140.1833,"ma120":1133.0583,"ma200":1229.32,"close_vs_ma200":-9.3808,"close_vs_ma60":-2.2964,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":71.6196,"r2_60":0.3163,"slope_120":0.2369,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":-34.0567,"r2_250":0.5953,"high52":1944.0,"low52":907.0,"pos_52w":19.9614,"dd_52w":-42.6955,"mdd_1y":-50.1837,"atr14_pct":10.3424,"vol_ann_60":40.3932,"vol_avg20":26040.7,"vol_ratio20":0.3748,"vr5":0.6433,"vr20":0.2479,"amount_avg5":21849334.4,"amount_avg20":30204872.2,"amount_avg60":32088296.2333,"obv_chg20":-51.2158,"turnover_20":1.4275,"pv_eff_20":-6.3997,"rsi14":44.3078,"frgn_net_5":2790.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0076,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0076,"frgn_net_20":-25350.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0695,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0695,"frgn_net_60":-81487.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.2233,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.2233,"frgn_net_120":100999.0,"inst_net_120":-700.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.2768,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0019,"smart_net_120_pct":0.2749,"foreign_ratio":1.3,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.14,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":19.0,"op_margin_q":13.8686,"op_qoq":111.1111,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":72.7273,"rev_yoy":-19.883,"op_trend_4q":83.3898,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.18,"debt_ratio":65.94,"per":69.63,"pbr":0.83,"div_yield":nul